OL,3,AI got paid $5,000 to move to a place
OL,4,AI'd never heard of
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Brianna Beyrouti looks back on her
OL,7,Fformer life in the city of Portland,
OL,8,FOregon, she says she had been
OL,9,Ffinancially "drowning".
OL,11,F"I was absolutely living paycheque to
OL,12,Fpaycheque. Every time the smallest
OL,13,Fthing came up, it was like 'Oh, gosh,
OL,14,Fthe kids need shoes, how am I going to
OL,15,Fafford that?' As a single parent,
OL,16,Feverything falls on my shoulders."
OL,18,FLast year, Brianna left Portland and
OL,19,Fits metropolitan population of 2.5
OL,20,Fmillion people.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
