OL,3,AI got paid $5,000 to move to a place
OL,4,AI'd never heard of
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe and her two children moved 2,000
OL,7,Fmiles east to Muncie, Indiana, a small
OL,8,Fcity with 65,000 people, a university
OL,9,Fand lots of open space, taking
OL,10,Fadvantage of a scheme that contributed
OL,11,F$5,000 towards the cost of the move to
OL,12,Fboost population growth.
